301,9 Conclusion This research introduces a scalable Bayesian frame- work decoupling physical building energy signals from economic behavior at the national scale.
302,"By utiliz- ing a sparse unchunked national graph representation with variational inference, we demonstrate that high- resolution hierarchical spatial modeling is computa- tionally feasible across 6,837 MSOAs using standard research hardware."
